TurboJev typed-field contracts, regression cases, numeric evaluation cases and
receipt/fair-die examples are informed by TypeLLM:
https://github.com/TypeLLM/TypeLLM
See evals/data/provenance.json for the original local reference identity.
The structured SDK extension additionally adapts TypeLLM 0.6.9 schema, array,
ordinal, described-choice, confidence and cookbook contracts; see
docs/TYPELLM_0_6_9_PORT.md for the source/feature mapping.
